+6. Compute the scale factor $s$ to map the bounding box to the range $[-1, 1]$. The side length of the bounding box is $L = v_{max} - v_{min}$. The maximum extent is $\max(L)$. The scale is:
+   $$ s = \frac{2}{\max(L)} $$
